CC-BY 4.0 permits redistribution and MODIFICATION (unlike a stricter case
elsewhere in this repository — the `xml` module excludes the James Clark
`xmltest` sub-suite entirely because ITS terms permit only unmodified
redistribution of the whole archive; see `modules/xml/NOTICE`). This module's
